<title>USA: Redding SD, Calif., won by BancAmerica Securities.</title>
<headline>Redding SD, Calif., won by BancAmerica Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>BancAmerica Securities said it won $7.215 million of Redding SD, Calif., 1991 general obligation bonds, Series F, with a true interest cost of 5.3244 percent.  </p>
